						<view class="demo-chip demo-chip--neutral">
							<text class="demo-chip__text demo-chip__text--neutral">vx-divider</text>
						</view>
					</view>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<view class="demo-section__head">
						<view class="demo-section__num">
							<text class="demo-section__num-text">01</text>
						</view>
						<view class="demo-section__copy">
							<text class="demo-section__title">基础横线</text>
							<text class="demo-section__desc">1px，默认 border 色，上下各留 12；它就是一条线，没有插槽和点击。</text>
						</view>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-card">
						<text class="demo-div-paragraph">第一段内容：分割线只负责分隔，不代替区块之间的 24 留白。</text>
						<vx-divider />
						<text class="demo-div-paragraph">第二段内容：同一个区块内部用 12，跨区块时仍由页面节奏决定。</text>
						<vx-divider />
						<text class="demo-div-paragraph">第三段内容：线色取 border，比列表行内的 divider 深一档。</text>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint demo-div-hint">spacing 不传时，横线上下各 12；它只是外边距，不改变线的宽度。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<view class="demo-section__head">
						<view class="demo-section__num">
							<text class="demo-section__num-text">02</text>
						</view>
						<view class="demo-section__copy">
							<text class="demo-section__title">带文字三种对齐</text>
							<text class="demo-section__desc">left 只画右侧线、right 只画左侧线、center 两侧各画一段等宽线。</text>
						</view>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-card">
						<text class="demo-div-label">align="left"</text>
						<vx-divider text="最近更新" align="left" />
						<text class="demo-div-label demo-div-label--spaced">align="center"</text>
